  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Temples_Reimagined/MP_MoogsTemplesReimagined_header.webp\" alt=\"banner\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fD1D8LKA5N\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fS5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/869218732650688543?color=008080&label=DISCORD&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/finndog_123/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-projects-008080?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge projects\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFinnDog_123\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-projects-008080?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth projects\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252ftemples-reimagined%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/c110cc09347a4f9f9de6c974f2fa35d8.png\" alt=\"View Structures\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Temples_Reimagined/MP_MoogsTemplesReimagined_overview.webp\" alt=\"Overview\"></p>\n<p>本模組支援 Forge、Fabric 和 NeoForge！請務必確認 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moogs-structure-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Moogs Structure Lib</a> 支援哪些版本。</p>\n<h3>關於</h3>\n<p>Moog's Temples Reimagined 在原版神殿的基礎上，新增了更大、經過全面改寫的神殿結構，而不會取代原版神殿。內容包含沙漠、叢林、海洋、貧瘠之地（Badlands）和下界神殿，以及一座自訂要塞。基於 MoogsStructureLib 建構。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252ftemples-reimagined%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/f8fe835413394a76b10a678afefea30f.png\" alt=\"Browse every structure live in 3D\"></a></p>\n<h3>需求</h3>\n<p><strong>MoogsStructureLib</strong> - 本模組需要安裝 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moogs-structure-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MoogsStructureLib</a> 才能運作。請確保已將該模組與本模組一同安裝。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Temples_Reimagined/MP_MoogsTemplesReimagined_features.webp\" alt=\"features &amp; showcase\"></p>\n<h3>結構</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>沙漠神殿</strong></li>\n<li><strong>叢林神殿</strong></li>\n<li><strong>海洋神殿</strong></li>\n<li><strong>貧瘠之地神殿</strong></li>\n<li><strong>下界神殿</strong></li>\n<li><strong>要塞</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/7edc1556b8934fe38ccc3179e2365c3c.png\" alt=\"collage\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Temples_Reimagined/MP_MoogsTemplesReimagined_discord.webp\" alt=\"discord\"></p>\n<p>獲得回覆最快且最好的方式是加入我們的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/S5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmoogsmods%253fr%253dcfmtr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Temples_Reimagined/MP_MoogsTemplesReimagined_promo.webp\" alt=\"BHsponser\"></a></p>",
